    <string name="profile_help_hint">Quick answers about bookings, payments and miles.</string>
    <string name="profile_help_demo">Skypass is a demo app; bookings are not real.</string>
    <string name="profile_faq_cancel_q">How do I cancel a stay or a car?</string>
    <string name="profile_faq_cancel_a">Open My trips, choose the booking and tap Cancel booking. Stays with free cancellation can be cancelled until the day before check-in, cars until 48 hours before pick-up.</string>
    <string name="profile_faq_pay_q">When do I pay for hotels and cars?</string>
    <string name="profile_faq_pay_a">At the hotel or the rental desk. Skypass holds the booking and nothing is charged in the app.</string>
    <string name="profile_faq_pass_q">Where is my boarding pass?</string>
    <string name="profile_faq_pass_a">In My trips under Flights. Once opened it stays on your phone, so it works offline at the gate.</string>
    <string name="profile_faq_gate_q">What if my gate changes?</string>
    <string name="profile_faq_gate_a">Home shows the live gate and status of your next flight, updated the moment the airline changes it.</string>
    <string name="profile_faq_miles_q">How do I earn miles?</string>
    <string name="profile_faq_miles_a">Every flight earns its distance in miles. Silver starts at 10,000 miles, Gold at 25,000 and Platinum at 50,000.</string>
    <string name="profile_faq_travellers_q">Can I book for someone else?</string>
    <string name="profile_faq_travellers_a">Yes. Add them under Passengers &amp; travel documents and pick them when you book; for stays and cars, change the guest or driver on the details step.</string>

